"><img alt=\"Belonging-305204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ca/Belonging-305204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">冬毛植绒披肩<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Critter Fur Shawl</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />200<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一件私人定制的毛披肩，主要材料为家养魔精的冬毛，由女主人亲手修剪收集；辅以蛛丝、合成纤维，以及仙境渡渡们遗落在荒原的饰羽。在制作过程中，没有任何动物或魔精受到伤害。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/40/Belonging-305205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">魔精宠物配饰\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">（一对装）</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Pair of Pet Accessories</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />89.9<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“新巴别塔”魔精公司出品的宠物配饰，满足宠物在正式场合的出席需求。<br />大众认为魔精对此产品表现的驯顺离不开神秘学咒语的力量，但设计师强调：起作用的是轻巧服贴的材质，以及关爱的心。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/Belonging-305206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">新艺术鱼尾长裙<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Art Nouveau Fishtail Skirt</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />60<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者珍藏的晚礼服，每逢重大的场合，她都会穿上这条长裙。<br />为了踏上更大更远的舞台，受访者在这件礼服上花费了她的第一笔收入。如今，她再次将它从衣柜中取出。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%A0%E7%A0%811.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 以善意加码1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%A0%E7%A0%811.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%A0%E7%A0%811.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%A0%E7%A0%811.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%A0%E7%A0%811.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BB%A5%E5%96%84%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%A0%E7%A0%811.jpg/456px-%E8%